  "contentHtml": "<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여름학기 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2014</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">). </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여름학기가 시작되었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">지난 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월에는 미국동부여행도 다녀오고 틈틈이 토플공부도 하며 여유있게 지냈는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">좋은 시절이 다 지나간 것이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여름학기는 이날부터 시작해서 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">까지 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주간 계속된다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">수업은 전공과목 하나와 어학원 영어 중 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">말하기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">를 선택했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단지 두 과목을 배우는데도 등록금은 정말 비싸서 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">300</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">만원을 훌쩍 넘는다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 아는 한 텍사스주립대는 미국 내에서 등록금이 가장 싼 대학이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기보다 싼 대학이 있다면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그곳은 아마도 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Community College</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라 부르는 전문대학일 것이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 한국에 있을 때 샅샅이 뒤졌는데 내 눈에는 없었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런데 여기가 이럴 정도면 다른 학교는 얼마나 비싸겠는가</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그런데도 다니는 사람들이 많은 것을 보면 다들 참 돈이 많은 모양이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">방학을 맞아 학교는 온통 공사중이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예전에 미시간주립대에서 연수받을 때 교수가 그랬다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미시간주립대에는 두 개의 시기가 있는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하나는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">construction period </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">다른 하나는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">destruction period </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">란다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">때려 부수고 또 짓고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교가 공사판이 되는 바람에 스쿨버스 정류장도 옮겨졌다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">버스타는 곳에서 가까운 곳에 이렇게 예쁜 건물이 있어서 카메라에 담아봤다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">건물 이름은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Richard A. Castro Undergraduate Admissions Center. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">건물의 이름은 길지만 앞은 사람의 이름인 것 같고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리말로 하면 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">대학입학처</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/234EFA4253B4DF9A1A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"55-1) 대학입학처-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_234EFA4253B4DF9A1A4079\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">봄학기부터 계속된 공사가 끝나가는 한쪽에서는 그동안 공사장 가림막 속에 있었던 학교 상징물이 모습을 드러냈다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이름은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bobcat. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리말로는 붉은 스라소니</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/214BD54253B4DF9C21\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"55-2) 밥캣-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_214BD54253B4DF9C2113C7\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">종업식 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2014</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">목</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">). </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">트래비스 초등학교가 여름방학에 들어갔다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">방학을 며칠 앞두고 각 학생들에게는 준비해야 할 음식물과 물품들이 지정되었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">큰 애에게 할당된 것은 접시와 냅킨이고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">작은 애는 음료수였다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이렇게 준비된 음식물들을 담임선생님이 학생들이 먹기 좋도록 배열해 놓고 나면 오후에 파티가 열린다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한국과 같은 형태의 방학식은 없고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생들에게 전달되어야 할 상장들은 미리 며칠 전에 학부모를 초청한 가운데 나누어줬다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 파티에는 학부모들도 참여할 수 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">파티라고는 하나 아이들이 어리다보니 특별히 어떤 행사가 진행되는 것은 아니고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그냥 애들은 접시에 음식을 담아서 먹으며 삼삼오오 어울리고 있었다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님은 교실 한쪽에서 노는 아이들을 지켜보고 계시고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">직감적으로 떠오르는 생각 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">‘</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 날은 수업하는 날보다 더 힘들겠구나</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">...’ </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이럴 때는 빨리 아이를 데리고 사라져드리는 것이 선생님을 돕는 것이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실제로 인사를 나누고 나니 특별히 할 말도 없다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그냥 그동안 가르쳐주셔서 정말 감사하다는 인사를 드렸고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님께서는 오히려 당신께서 행복했다는 말씀을 하셨다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기는 지금 학년이 끝나는 상황이라 오늘이 종업식이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리 부부는 며칠 전에 두 아이의 담임선생님들과 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">ESL</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">선생님께 작은 선물을 준비해서 드렸다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아이들이 미국에 와서 이토록 잘 적응하고 학교생활에 만족하는 것은 모두 이 분들의 덕분이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2746074253B4DF9D2F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"55-3) 트래비스교실-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2746074253B4DF9D2FED2E\"/></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-align: justify; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사족</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">한국에서 대학의 상징이라고 하면 내가 아는 것은 연세대의 독수리와 고려대의 호랑이 뿐이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 나온 대학의 동물도 뭐였는지 모르겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">있는데 모르는 건지 없어서 모르는 건지도 모르겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이곳에서 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bobcat</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">은 어디서나 볼 수 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">서점에 가면 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bobat </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그림이 그려진 티셔츠</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">각종 기념품</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학용품이 걸려 있고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생 봉사활동의 이름도 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bobcat Build, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교내 알바사이트도 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Jobsforcats, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교버스의 이름도 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bobcat Trail... </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">3) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">트래비스 초등학교는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">6</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">금</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">부터 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">8</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">월 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">24</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">까지 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">80</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일간 여름방학을 갖는다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이렇듯 여름방학은 부러울 만큼 길지만 대신 겨울방학은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">일 정도 밖에 되지 않는다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">4) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국은 같은 선생님이 같은 학년을 계속 맡는 것이 일반적이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">반면 한국에서는 교사의 희망이나 학교 업무상의 필요에 의하여 담당 학년을 배정하거나 입학한 학생들을 데리고 졸업할 때까지 학년을 올라가면서 지도하는 것이 일반적이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그럼 어느 방식이 더 좋을까</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">? </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 전에 미국 선생님들한테 한 학년을 오래 지도하면 지겹지 않는냐고 물었더니 그들은 그렇다고 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">반면 한국에서처럼 아이들을 데리고 올라가면서 지도하면 학생을 파악하는데 도움이 되고 학생들과 친밀감도 깊어져서 좋다고 생각한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. (</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물론 반대의 경우도 생각할 수 있는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">어차피 그런 선생님은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년을 가르쳐도 애들한테 인정을 못 받는다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국에서는 한 학년을 계속 지도하게 함으로서 교과전문성을 기른다고 하는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이론상으로는 그럴듯해 보여도 실상은 다르다고 생각한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  </p><p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); tab-stops: left blank 316.0pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기서는 학부모가 교실에서 자기 아이를 데리고 집에 가는 것도 허용되지 않았다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리 부부는 약간 당황스럽기까지 했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교실에서 바로 데려가는 것이 아니라 행정실에 와서 신분증을 제시하며 정식으로 신청을 하면</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">행정실에서는 방송으로 교실에 알리고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그러면 담임선생님은 아이를 내려 보내준다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
}